---
 blueprint/design-language-k2.md |  2 +-
 design/README.md                |  4 ++--
 design/gallery.html             | 12 ++++++++----
 design/icons.svg                |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/blueprint/design-language-k2.md b/blueprint/design-language-k2.md
index 5206fb5..4a529ab 100644
--- a/blueprint/design-language-k2.md
+++ b/blueprint/design-language-k2.md
@@ -41,7 +41,7 @@ Amber means *you have something to confirm* on work lists and *practising* on a
 
 ## Icons (`design/gallery.html`, `design/icons.svg`)
 
-- One open-source set, **Lucide** (ISC licence, `design/LICENSES/`). 41 icons, one per concept, copied unchanged.
+- One open-source set, **Lucide** (ISC licence, `design/LICENSES/`). 50 icons, one per concept, copied unchanged.
 - Every status is **icon + colour + one word**. Never colour alone, never an icon alone.
 - **Outcomes:** ↑ above (neem), ↓ below (mud), = as expected, open hand for not willing, crossed person for absent (grey).
 - **Work:** ✓ in a circle for done, clock for to confirm, ⚠ for fix this (the only red), empty ring for to do, hourglass for late.
diff --git a/design/README.md b/design/README.md
index b28384e..d2f830c 100644
--- a/design/README.md
+++ b/design/README.md
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # design/: icons for Teacher OS
 
-- `icons.svg`: one SVG sprite, 41 symbols, each `id="i-<concept>"` (for example `i-fix-this`).
+- `icons.svg`: one SVG sprite, 50 symbols, each `id="i-<concept>"` (for example `i-fix-this`).
 - `gallery.html`: every icon at 16, 24 and 40 px, on light and dark, with its concept, colour token and word.
 - `LICENSES/lucide-LICENSE.txt`: the licence the icons ship under. Keep it with any copy.
 
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 
 Icons are copied unchanged from **Lucide**, npm package `lucide-static` 1.67.0, read on 2026-11-03.
 Licence: **ISC**, from the package's own `LICENSE` file (part of it is MIT, from Feather; both are in the file).
-Only the 41 icons listed in `gallery.html` are copied. Why Lucide:
+Only the 50 icons listed in `gallery.html` are copied. Why Lucide:
 - one stroke style on a 24 px grid;
 - ISC lets the school use, change and ship the icons freely, provided the notice is kept;
 - there is a React package (`lucide-react`) for the site.
